# Scenario name
msgid "Iris Siege"
msgstr ""

# Scenario description
msgid ""
"The system holds destructive nebulae at bay but enemies sabotage our "
"defensive apparatus. Stop them before the system is overwhelmed.\n"
"\n"
"Designed for one or more player ships. Terrain changes each time the "
"scenario is run. Scenario inspired by aspects of a scenario written by "
"srps.\n"
"\n"
"Version 1\n"
"\n"
"USN Discord: https://discord.gg/PntGG3a where you can join a game online. "
"There's usually one every weekend. All experience levels are welcome."
msgstr ""

